rnational non-governmental organization for erth sciences Headquartered in Beijing. Founded 1961.", "newValue": "The International Union of Geological Sciences (IUGS), established in 1961, is a pivotal international non-governmental organization headquartered in Beijing, China, dedicated to advancing the geosciences globally. This organization emerged from a need to foster international cooperation among geologists and geological societies, aiming to address critical issues such as earth resource management and environmental challenges. Key figures in its formation included geologists from various nations who recognized the necessity of collaboration across borders to tackle the complexities of earth sciences in the context of increasing global interdependence.

